  "description": "The Rootdown Ti takes the tried and tested geometry of the Rootdown and pairs it with the almost magical properties of Titanium. With an incredibly high strength to weight ratio, a silky, paint-less finish and our custom CNC’d dropouts, yoke, and braces, the Rootdown Ti is an elegant beauty that is ready for the rough stuff.\nIts ductility means we can create an incredibly light frame, but still maintain compliance and quality ride feel that Chromag are known for. It's also extremely resistant to corrosion, so we can show off its clean, consistent welds and natural brilliance!\nThe Rootdown Ti is a beast! It features an extra robust heavy-gauge front triangle and a massive 51mm downtube, yet at 4.65lbs (med), it still saves 2lbs over its steel counterpart.\nThe Rootdown Ti features a 12 x 148mm Boost rear end, and is compatible with tires up to 29\" x 2.5 and 27.5+ up to 2.8 wheels.\n\nCheck out the original steel Rootdown.\nLooking for the Canadian made version? Check out the Primer.",
